etary","licenseUrl":"https://www.databricks.com/jdbc-odbc-driver-license","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The Simba Apache Spark ODBC Connector is used for direct SQL and HiveQL access to Apache Hadoop / Spark distributions, enabling Business Intelligence (BI), analytics, and reporting on Hadoop-based data. The connector efficiently transforms an application’s SQL query into the equivalent form in HiveQL, which is a subset of SQL-92. If an application is Spark-aware, then the connector is configurable to pass the query through to the database for processing. The connector interrogates Spark to obtain schema information to present to a SQL-based application. Queries, including joins, are translated from SQL to HiveQL","name":"Simba Spark ODBC Driver","packageUrl":"https://www.databricks.com/spark/odbc-drivers-download","publisher":"Simba Technologies Inc.","publisherUrl":"https://www.databricks.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://databricks-bi-artifacts.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/simbaspark-drivers/odbc/2.9.2/docs/release-notes.txt","tags":["databricks","odbc","spark"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Simba Apache Spark ODBC 连接器，用于直接通过 SQL 和 HiveQL 访问 Apache Hadoop/Spark 发行版。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Simba Apache Spark ODBC 连接器用于直接通过 SQL 和 HiveQL 访问 Apache Hadoop/Spark 发行版，实现对基于 Hadoop 数据的商业智能(BI)、分析和报表功能。该连接器能高效地将应用程序的 SQL 查询转换为等效的 HiveQL 形式（HiveQL 是 SQL-92 的子集）。若应用程序支持 Spark，连接器可配置为将查询直接传递给数据库处理。连接器会向 Spark 获取模式信息，以供基于 SQL 的应用程序使用。包括连接操作在内的各类查询均可从 SQL 转换为 HiveQL。","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.databricks.com/","releaseDate":"2025-04-25","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://databricks-bi-artifacts.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/simbaspark-drivers/odbc/2.9.2/docs/release-notes.txt","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/Databricks/SparkODBCDriver/2.9.2/Databricks.SparkODBCDriver.yaml","sha256":"b458